WEBVTT

00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:14,000
is a ketogenic diet appropriate for every cancer patient.

00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,400
So if you've been with me long enough,

00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,760
you know the answer to that is no.

00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:22,760
So in general, though, doing a keto-like type diet

00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:27,400
would be, I guess, appropriate for every person,

00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,360
period, not even cancer.

00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,640
You don't want to be eating a lot of sugar.

00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,480
So when you're eating a ton of carbs,

00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:35,960
I know there are carbohydrates,

00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:39,160
carbs, you know, root deterians,

00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,400
all this kind of stuff out there in the world

00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,680
and you could find some YouTube videos on people

00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:47,880
that only eat fruit or only eat grains or I don't know.

00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:51,280
I just don't know that that's how we were mentally

00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:55,680
and certainly people that are vegetarians

00:00:55,680 --> 00:01:00,400
are certainly eating a lot more carbohydrates in general, too.

00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:05,400
So, but I would suggest that it would probably

00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:10,400
be in the best interest of most people on the planet

00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,480
to be eating less carbohydrates.

00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:14,760
Certainly most people in the United States

00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:18,760
since we have been a pharmacolic nation for a long time.

00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:21,160
So eating a more of a keto-like diet

00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:25,600
to think that keto diet is technically getting in ketosis

00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:28,000
to think that we only need to be in ketosis

00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,120
is I think very incorrect.

00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:35,280
Our cells are made to feed off of glucose

00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,640
and that's how we produce energy.

00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:39,640
But for a cancer patient,

00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
to never cancer patient be on a ketogenic diet.

00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,200
No, I don't think so either,

00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:45,520
but again, eating more keto-like

00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,960
would be more appropriate.

